msgstr ""

msgid "Back-Channel Logout attempt"
msgstr ""

msgid "Back-Channel Logout attempts"
msgstr ""

msgid "Code hash"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"sha256 hex digest of the authorization code. One-way by construction — the "
"plaintext code is never stored."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Snapshot of the application's client_id at row-insert time. Survives RP "
"deletion (FK becomes NULL) so per-RP forensic queries still work for "
"``reuse_count>=1`` rows after the originating app is gone."
msgstr ""
"Снимок client_id приложения на момент вставки строки. Переживает удаление "
"RP (FK становится NULL), поэтому per-RP forensic-запросы продолжают работать "
"для строк с ``reuse_count>=1`` после удаления исходного приложения."

msgid "Access token PK"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Integer primary key of the AccessToken row issued by this code exchange. "
"Resolved at reuse-detection time."
msgstr ""

msgid "Refresh token PK"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Integer primary key of the RefreshToken row issued by this code exchange. "
"Resolved at reuse-detection time."
msgstr ""

msgid "Reuse count"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Number of times this code was presented at /o/token/ after the original "
"exchange. >= 1 indicates a security-relevant replay attempt."
msgstr ""

